<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz W to enter main mkt Aug 4.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz W to enter main mkt Aug 4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish builder Elektromontaz Warszawa SA will transfer its shares to the Warsaw bourse's main market from the parallel floor on August 4, bourse deputy head Ryszard Czerniawski told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
